    <string name="about_open">About readme.club ›</string>
    <string name="about_promise">Everything your e-ink device needs, in one place.</string>
    <string name="about_body">readme.club is an independent e-ink media. We use the devices, write the guides we wished we\'d had, and gather what the community makes — firmware, wallpapers, fonts — in one place, for every brand we cover.</string>
    <string name="about_creator">Created by Florent Bertiaux.</string>
    <string name="about_thanks">It would be nothing without the team and the volunteers — and above all, without every one of you who visits.</string>
    <string name="about_account_title">The full experience</string>
    <string name="about_account_body">It\'s complete with a free member account on the website: wallpaper favorites, your reading list, your member card.</string>
    <string name="about_account_phone">On your phone, scan this code or open:</string>
